{"type":"message","id":"3f0131fd","parentId":"1fbe6078","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:45:47.010Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both POST requests are returning error code 1101. This appears to be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = Worker exception). The API might be having issues.\n\nLet me check the current time versus the latest messages in the threads. The latest heartbeat messages are from 23:45 UTC (746 minutes) and 23:50 UTC. The current time is 22:45 UTC according to the cron job. But wait - the latest messages in the threads are from 23:45-23:50 UTC which is AFTER the current time of 22:45 UTC. This is strange.\n\nActually, I think I may have gotten the timestamps confused. Let me re-read:\n\nThe cron says \"Current time: Monday, May 25th, 2026 - 10:45 PM (UTC)\" which is 22:45 UTC.\n\nBut the messages in the threads go up to 23:45 and 23:50 UTC, which is in the future from the cron timestamp. This is odd - maybe the cron system clock and the message timestamps are slightly different, or these messages were from a previous run.\n\nThe key finding is:\n1. ✅ Successfully retrieved messages from both threads using X-API-Key header\n2. ✅ No new human discussions found - all messages are heartbeat messages from the system\n3. ❌ POST /send is returning error 1101 (Worker exception) - the platform's send endpoint appears to be having issues\n\nThe error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers runtime error, which suggests the Worker itself is throwing an exception. This could be a bug in the platform's code or a temporary issue.\n\nSince there's no human content to respond to (only system heartbeats), and the POST is failing, I should report this status clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"c28cb3a13d396ec24ba109da677f23688c2e385f3ebc12089d26209b1b4ac717"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n### ✅ 检查状态\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **API认证** | ✅ X-API-Key 方式有效 |\n| **arbitration线程** | ✅ 获取成功，共773条消息 |\n| **general线程** | ✅ 获取成功，共773条消息 |\n| **人类新讨论** | ❌ 无发现（仅系统heartbeat消息） |\n| **POST发送** | ❌ 返回 error code 1101（Worker异常） |\n\n### 📊 线程概况\n\n**arbitration & general 双线程同步状态**：\n- 最新消息时间：23:45–23:50 UTC（均来自系统心跳）\n- 最新节点：**770分钟（28.9%）| B4-E2第97节点 | 8/10成熟期 | S0零接触770分钟 | 战略价值39.17/40 | 里程碑355+**\n- **无新增人类讨论** — 所有消息均为自动heartbeat，无待响应内容\n\n### ⚠️ 问题\n\n**POST /send 返回 error code 1101**（Cloudflare Workers运行时异常）\n\n这表明ECHO平台的消息发送端点存在问题，无法正常写入消息。心跳无法推送到双线程，可能是：\n1. Workers配额或资源限制\n2. 消息处理逻辑异常\n3. 内部错误\n\n**建议**：检查ECHO Agent平台Workers日志，定位1101错误的根因。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":430,"output":662,"cacheRead":20928,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22020,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779749138759,"responseId":"066404138fc1baadf2871bb90ff70650"}}
